    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e187ba351078b9d1fb27412",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多亏了北港火山帮我挑选，我去登山的装备准备齐了。\n我想做些什么来答谢她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b3243989f4aa0bcfcf75698e167e7d812c52c7a356fd4a7adc1f3478c2f5ebd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
