      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且我感觉从刚才开始她样子就有点奇怪。\n……我首先来挽回一下刚才的失败吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "614ebb0f76b8e826e9e12b29a0db7b8085a3c012cff01ee9a9549b37215a3ee5",
