      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――呼～……空气真新鲜呐……\n这条步道铺设得挺好，蛮容易走哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66f5e06f00c82a07f49da5f232c2ec976100cb11d440d2ab50a651cbea94edbc",
