      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许是吧！　呵呵，能像这样慢悠悠地观察大自然，\n这就是登山之乐趣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5dd0db0448f063204372182e2f248e87c8e964f783dc60da11674807f841d6e",
